th source boundary</p></article><article class="intel-card"><h2>Update discipline</h2><p>Weekly by default; faster during official releases, elections, filings, court events, crisis or sanctions changes.</p></article><article class="intel-card"><h2>Conclusion</h2><ul><li>The page should show official source, symbol reading and boundary.</li></ul></article><article class="intel-card"><h2>Boundary</h2><p>Agenda 2030 / SDG / global-governance alignment is tracked as public-record policy alignment, not as proof of wrongdoing by itself.</p></article></div></section><section class="section wrap"><h2>Related machine routes</h2><div class="cta-row"><a class="btn" href="../mission-source-priority.html">Source Priority</a><a class="btn alt" href="../evidence-graph.html">Evidence Graph</a><a class="btn alt" href="../control-map-daily.html">Visual Control Map</a><a class="btn alt" href="../deep-intel-feed.html">Deep Intel Feed</a></div></section><section id="atlas-lane-population" class="section wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Populated Source Leads</div><h2>Logos — top relevant records, people and institutions</h2><p class="lead">This page is populated with the strongest public-record leads for the site mission. These are evidence routes and alignment checks, not accusations.</p><div class="intel-grid"><article class="intel-card"><span>Logo / visual-identity route</span><h3>UN logo</h3><p>Track official brand page, symbol reading, stated identity and interpretation boundary.</p><p><strong>Evidence:</strong> Public-record source lane</p><p><strong>Boundary:</strong> Tracks documented public alignment, office, funding, policy, ownership or source route; not a claim of wrongdoing.</p><a href="../evidence-vault.html">Open source lane</a></article><article class="intel-card"><span>Logo / visual-identity route</span><h3>WHO logo</h3><p>Track official brand page, symbol reading, stated identity and interpretation boundary.</p><p><strong>Evidence:</strong> Public-record source lane</p><p><